// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2118095681" "Parts for the Facemaker!"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1574068883" "The Facemaker needs a constant supply of parts!"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3854880183" "Business is brisk in the extreme makeover business."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1698269601" "Parts is parts."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1510672447" "Feeble creature.  Your skin will look better on a paying customer!"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2321234632" "Struggling will only make your precious skin tear."

// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2549624118" "Interfering sack of organs!"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P263768344" "You'll have to buy your parts at the Facemaker like everyone else."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2825271981" "Am-scray, Fleshy."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2650249167" "These parts is mine."
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2751307506" "These organs are mine!"
// HUNTING_HUNTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P672353054" "Begone, Fleshy."

// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3667188706" "Oh, wow, man."
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201120844" "NO!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4102293893" "I will resist!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3887692329" "Please stop!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P7794216" "Ow, ow, ow. That's it!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4130920135" "This is not happening!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P29673683" "Calm blue ocean... Calm blue ocean...  Go to your happy place."
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2056285975" "Please make it stop!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4229321524" "I don't want to be parts!"
// VAHZILOK_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P75781215" "I don't want to be someone's new face!"

// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P1944069284" "Whoa, watch where you point that thing!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P3840325132" "Man, I love beating on these things.  Big sacks of dumb."
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P726428822" "Sarge said to go practice on some target dummies.  Well, they don't get any dumber than this!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P137647129" "Ha Ha!  Look at it furrowing its brow in a vain attempt to understand!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P1734649439" "Man, these things are dumber than a sack of hammers!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_INACTIVE :
"P3208972265" "You weren't kidding! This thing is dumber than a sack of hair."

// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_ALERT :
"P3729479179" "Okay, fun time is over, back to work."
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_ALERT :
"P2642901532" "Get your own toy beast to play with.  This one is ours!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_ALERT :
"P2149427809" "Fight this thing later, we got trouble!"
// CAP_ARACHNOS_BEATDOWN_VAHZILOK_ALERT :
"P477579189" "'Chosen' Filth on your six!"

// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3607155599" "This is a bountiful supply of inventory for the Facemaker!"
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2328600217" "This load will do nicely for the Facemaker."
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2233764619" "The Facemaker has such a demand for... uhh.. 'Costumes' that we don't even have time to refrigerate this stock."
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P75906606" "New faces for all! There is bounty of fresh meat these days!"
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3641485188" "Fresh meat! Well... Somewhat fresh."

// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1187800543" "Protect the inventory!"
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2451252525" "Harvest your own meat!"
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2869177202" "My stock. Mine!"
// CAP_FACEMAKER_BODYPILE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1112862080" "This is my load of meat!  The bounty is mine!"

